Quiet Night is an independent fork of Granular Volume / Quiet Dial by Rzuss and contributors.
Upstream source: https://github.com/Rzuss/granular-volume
Quiet Night source: https://github.com/JaredTweed/QuietNight

The application source is distributed under GPL-3.0-only; see LICENSE.
Quiet Night changes are by Jared Tweed and contributors. Original authorship and upstream history are retained.

Runtime third-party components include AndroidX, Material Components for Android,
Kotlin, and Kotlin Coroutines, under Apache-2.0. Attribution and the Apache-2.0
license are available inside the app under More options > Licenses.

The only bundled executable build binary is the official Gradle wrapper JAR
(Apache-2.0). Gradle distributions are downloaded from services.gradle.org with
SHA-256 verification. Historical marketing assets are not bundled in the APK.
